        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Le nez de Tarinor, qui fonctionne comme une boussole infaillible, en fait un allié de choix pour tout Dresseur Pokémon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The magnet in Nosepass’s nose provides an unerring compass, making it an excellent partner for Trainers going on a journey.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ノズパスの　鼻の　磁石は 絶対　狂わないので　旅する トレーナーの　良き　パートナーだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa puissance magnétique lui sert à attirer ses proies, mais également des objets métalliques qu’il utilise en guise de bouclier.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It uses powerful magnetism to drag its prey toward it. It’s also been known to pull in metal, which it collects and uses to protect itself.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "強力な　磁力で　獲物を 引き寄せる。　鉄を　引き寄せ 身を　守ることも　ある。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il ne se déplace que d’un centimètre par an, mais s’il se sent menacé, il virevolte et s’enfonce dans le sol en un instant.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It moves less than an inch a year, but when it’s in a jam, it will spin and drill down into the ground in a split second.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "１年に　１センチしか　動かないが ピンチに　陥ると　回転し 一瞬で　地中に　潜る。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Grâce à sa force magnétique, il peut chasser ses proies sans se déplacer, mais il attire parfois ses pires ennemis.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It hunts without twitching a muscle by pulling in its prey with powerful magnetism. But sometimes it pulls natural enemies in close.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "強力な　磁力で　獲物を 引き寄せ　動かず　狩りを　するが 天敵を　引き寄せることもある。",
